    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>护甲（中甲），非普通（需同调）</em></p><p>穿着这套护甲期间，你可以用其施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交谈 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死尸 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法术后，直到次日黎明为止这套护甲都无法再次被用于施展这两个法术。</p><p>这套盔甲会随着你灵魂的离去而消逝。若你在同调这套护甲期间死亡，这套护甲也将随之摧毁。</p><p>一种由厚毛皮制作的粗糙护甲。常见使用人群包括：野蛮人部落、邪恶类人生物以及其它缺少资源制作更好护甲的人。</p><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>This crude armor consists of thick furs and pelts. It is commonly worn by barbarian tribes, evil humanoids, and other folk who lack access to the tools and materials needed to create better armor.</p>",
